  abilityId: 30866
  abilityName: Imperial Charge
  abilityDesc: 12 combo Earth attack on all foes, adds probable 1 turn Atk reduction
    effect to attack for 3 turns, boosts Atk and Def for Earth types for 3 turns
    & slight damage reduction from Water, Thunder types for 2 turns
